{"id":"9ced46394294c1a6","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-quotient.md","title":"Quotient Set","display":"df-quotient — Quotient Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-quotient","aliases":["58-df-quotient"],"display":"df-quotient — Quotient Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-quotient-set]]","[[58-df-equivalence]]","[[58-df-equivalenceclass]]","[[58-df-powerset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quotient — Quotient Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e668662ec71d852\" href=\"?note=2e668662ec71d852\" title=\"58-df-zfc-quotient-set\">58-df-zfc-quotient-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a891abf5fe2909c\" href=\"?note=1a891abf5fe2909c\" title=\"58-df-equivalence\">58-df-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e133c3f5752a16a\" href=\"?note=0e133c3f5752a16a\" title=\"58-df-equivalenceclass\">58-df-equivalenceclass</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,A,R,C,x\\in V\">\\(Q,A,R,C,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1a891abf5fe2909c\" href=\"?note=1a891abf5fe2909c\" title=\"58-df-equivalence\">58-df-equivalence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0e133c3f5752a16a\" href=\"?note=0e133c3f5752a16a\" title=\"58-df-equivalenceclass\">58-df-equivalenceclass</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (canonical quotient predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2e668662ec71d852\" href=\"?note=2e668662ec71d852\" title=\"58-df-zfc-quotient-set\">58-df-zfc-quotient-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientByClasses}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientByClasses}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (class-presented quotient predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}by\\text{-}classes} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientByClasses}_S(Q,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,A)\\land\nQ=\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\mid\\exists x\\in A\\;\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S(C,x,R,A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}by\\text{-}classes} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientByClasses}_S(Q,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,A)\\land\nQ=\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\mid\\exists x\\in A\\;\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S(C,x,R,A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}agreement} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientByClasses}_S(Q,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,A,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}agreement} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientByClasses}_S(Q,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,A,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical quotient predicate is imported rather than defined a second time.  The local, distinctly named predicate presents the same quotient through the actual four-place equivalence-class predicate, and the agreement theorem connects the two interfaces; no undeclared class operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x]_R\">\\([x]_R\\)</span> is assumed.</li>\n<li>Formation of the quotient is guarded by the equivalence-relation condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-quotient-set","status":"resolved","id":"2e668662ec71d852","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-quotient-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalenceclass","status":"resolved","id":"0e133c3f5752a16a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalenceclass]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-equivalence]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalenceclass","status":"resolved","id":"0e133c3f5752a16a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-equivalenceclass]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-quotient-set","status":"resolved","id":"2e668662ec71d852","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (canonical quotient predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-quotient-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q,A,R,C,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientByClasses}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}by\\text{-}classes} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientByClasses}_S(Q,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}(R,A)\\land\nQ=\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\mid\\exists x\\in A\\;\\mathrm{EquivalenceClass}_S(C,x,R,A)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}agreement} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientByClasses}_S(Q,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,A,R)","display":true},{"tex":"[x]_R","display":false}],"bytes":1527,"backlinks":[{"id":"34946ea21ee88f10","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S$ (quotient-set predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-quotient.md]])"},{"id":"002f4c0140c1d3c2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-quotient.md]])"},{"id":"a2431acf52348150","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-quotient.md]])"},{"id":"37a3e43a3599a849","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · d